From 6eda8938a790f65bd24fcfaae7b40ad4613fb7a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cezary Rojewski <cezary.rojewski@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 13:17:45 +0200
Subject: ASoC: codecs: rt274: Fix format setting for 44100 rate
Mime-version: 1.0
Content-type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-transfer-encoding: 8bit
Git-commit: 6eda8938a790f65bd24fcfaae7b40ad4613fb7a2
Patch-mainline: v7.3-rc6
References: git-fixes

As per specification, Sample Base Rate (bit 14)
shall be set to 1 for 44.1 kHz.

Fixes: c7e79b2b2d2d ("ASoC: rt274: add rt274 codec driver")
Signed-off-by: Amadeusz Sławiński <amade@asmblr.net>
Signed-off-by: Cezary Rojewski <cezary.rojewski@intel.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260918111745.3589393-2-cezary.rojewski@intel.com
Signed-off-by: Mark Brown <broonie@kernel.org>
Acked-by: Takashi Iwai <tiwai@suse.de>

---
 sound/soc/codecs/rt274.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/rt274.c b/sound/soc/codecs/rt274.c
index f8c370106504..3c47f1ae8db9 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/rt274.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/rt274.c
@@ -619,9 +619,11 @@ static int rt274_hw_params(struct snd_pcm_substream *substream,
 	unsigned int val = 0;
 	int d_len_code = 0, c_len_code = 0;
 
+	/* bit 14 Sample Rate Base, 0: 48kHz 1: 44.1kHz */
 	switch (params_rate(params)) {
-	/* bit 14 0:48K 1:44.1K */
 	case 44100:
+		val |= BIT(14);
+		break;
 	case 48000:
 		break;
 	default:
-- 
2.55.0

